28/Apr/26 5:17 AM;61138a4ce6e6f80071686ffa;Hi Team,

I hope you're well.

I just want to jump in here regarding the recent changes which we will need to update/revert.


 {color:#1d1c1d}*Step 1: All  +Q1+ updates need to be made from Customer Segmentation Doc*{color}{color:#1d1c1d}{color}
[https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1qTLnfMWEXJSlwhFdqdmpPQyc3r9n8tnR7yS7PK-GiN4/edit?usp=drive_web&ouid=118022776703423934306|https://url.de.m.mimecastprotect.com/s/g6-1CgpRqkclNQALzINfrT4o0UF?domain=docs.google.com]{color:#1d1c1d}

 *Step 2: No Accounts moves for Q2.*{color}
* {color:#1d1c1d}Move all Anthea’s accounts to Emma Witting (excluding Q2 accounts - it's important Q1 movs happen first otherwise harukas accounts will go to emma).{color}
* {color:#1d1c1d}Using the spreadsheet, reassign:{color}
* {color:#1d1c1d}Abbey Thompson (excluding Q2){color}
* {color:#1d1c1d}Cynthia Tian (excluding Q2 cases){color}{color:#1d1c1d}{color}



{color:#1d1c1d}A few issues i've identified{color}
* {color:#1d1c1d}Emma has a total of 17 accounts which is incorrect{color}
* {color:#1d1c1d}Antheas accounts don't have any CSM assigned and are appearing under null){color}
* {color:#1d1c1d}Q2 accounts in Abbeys/Antheas name need to sit in my name{color}

{color:#1d1c1d}Thanks,{color}
{color:#1d1c1d}Tess{color}

