Hi team,

{color:#bf2600}*SFA is facing a problem MW successfully:*{color}

There are 2 teams on 2 separate accounts, both need to track Tiktok content. However, Tiktok connection can only be connected to 1 account. To solve the issue, we need to merge the accounts so Tiktok content is visible to both teams. {color:#0747a6}*We need advice on the best way to do this.*{color}

 

# SFA horizon scanning - [https://meltwater.lightning.force.com/lightning/r/Opportunity/006Rf00000N0SuZIAV/view|https://meltwater.lightning.force.com/lightning/r/Opportunity/006Rf00000N0SuZIAV/view|smart-link]  - this is the older deal
