01/Apr/26 11:51 AM;712020:b25610b8-0a16-4c62-943a-b269d509e649;Hi Juri,



I hope you're well.



I wanted to flag a discrepancy I've noticed with the annual contract value and would appreciate your help in getting this corrected.



Based on my calculations, the annual contract value should be $28,442, broken down as follows:



• Order 1: AUD $43,866 over 24 months (Sep 2024 – Aug 2026) = $1,828/month

• Order 2: AUD $14,104 over 26 months (Jul 2024 – Aug 2026) = $543/month

• Combined monthly: $2,370 x 12 = $28,442 per year



However, the system is currently showing an annual contract value of $34,953, which doesn't align with the above.



Could you please help me understand the discrepancy and get this updated to reflect the correct value of $28,442?



Thank you for your assistance.

