{color}
* {color:#333}You are  *not required to possess* personal data about this consumer to process this deletion request. If you do not maintain any personal information about the consumer, please confirm this in writing. 
{color}
* {color:#333}This request applies regardless of the consumer's residency or past relationship with your organization, as many privacy laws provide rights based on data processing activities rather than solely on residency. 
{color}
* {color:#333}We are submitting this request to all data brokers that may potentially possess the consumer's information, as permitted under applicable privacy laws.{color} 


h3. {color:#333}{color}{color:#e65100}Response Requirements:{color}
{color:#e65100}{color}{color:#333} 

Please confirm receipt of this request within  *10 business days* and complete the deletion within the timeframe required by applicable law: 
{color}
* {color:#333}30 days under GDPR (extendable to 60 days with notice) 
{color}
* {color:#333}45 days under CCPA (extendable to 90 days with notice) 
{color}
* {color:#333}45 days under VCDPA, CPA, and CTDPA (extendable with notice) 


Upon completion, please provide written confirmation specifying: 
{color}
* {color:#333}Which categories of personal information were deleted, OR 
{color}
* {color:#333}Confirmation that no personal information was found in your systems{color} 

h3. {color:#333}{color}{color:#2c3e50}About CrabClear:{color}
{color:#2c3e50}{color}{color:#333} 

This request is submitted by meetergo GmbH (doing business as CrabClear) as an authorized agent acting on behalf of the consumer identified above. We implement reasonable security procedures to protect consumer information and use consumer data only for request fulfillment, verification, and fraud prevention as required by regulation. We maintain all consumer authorizations on file and can provide additional documentation upon request. 

 *We are registered at:*
 Hauptstrasse 44, 40789 Monheim am Rhein, Germany 

Should you have any questions about this request or need additional information, please contact us at{color} [{color:#333}privacy@crabclear.com{color}|mailto:privacy@crabclear.com]{color:#333}. 

Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter. 

Sincerely,  

 *CrabClear Data Privacy Team* 

meetergo GmbH 

Hauptstrasse 44 

40789 Monheim am Rhein, Germany 

