h3. {color:#333}{color}{color:#2c3e50}Legal Authorization:{color}
{color:#2c3e50}{color}{color:#333} 

I am acting as an authorized agent on behalf of the above-named consumer. The consumer has provided written authorization dated  *October 2, 2025*, which I maintain on file and have attached to this email. Under applicable regulations, businesses cannot require Power of Attorney for authorized agent requests (11 CCR § 7063(b)).{color} 
h3. {color:#333}{color}{color:#2c3e50}Scope of Request:{color}
{color:#2c3e50}{color}{color:#333} 

This request encompasses: 
{color}
