Subject: Formal Request for Data Deletion and Removal from Meltwater Media Directory
To: [journalists@meltwater.com|mailto:journalists@meltwater.com] <[journalists@meltwater.com|mailto:journalists@meltwater.com]>, <[privacy@meltwater.com|mailto:privacy@meltwater.com]>





{color:#172B4D}Dear Meltwater Privacy Team,{color} 

{color:#172B4D}I am writing to formally request the permanent deletion of all personal information associated with me from the Meltwater Media Directory and any affiliated systems or data-sharing partners. I am not a journalist or media contact, and I have not granted consent for the inclusion or processing of my personal data in your database.{color} 

{color:#172B4D}Pursuant to applicable data-protection and privacy laws, including the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA), I am exercising my right to:{color} 
#  

{color:#172B4D}Request erasure of my personal data from all Meltwater systems and third-party recipients.{color} 
#  

{color:#172B4D}Withdraw consent for any future collection, processing, or dissemination of my information.{color} 
#  

{color:#172B4D}Receive confirmation in writing once deletion has been completed.{color} 


{color:#172B4D}Please remove all records associated with the following information and confirm compliance with this request:{color} 

{color:#172B4D}Name: Dr. Ladona K. Clayton
 Email: l{color}[{color:#172B4D}adona.clayton@ogalwc.org{color}|mailto:adona.clayton@ogalwc.org]{color:#172B4D}{color} 

{color:#172B4D}Please provide confirmation within the timeframe required by applicable law.{color} 

{color:#172B4D}Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter.{color} 

{color:#172B4D}Sincerely,{color}

{color:#172B4D}Dr. Ladona K. Clayton{color}



-- 





