22/Oct/25 2:56 AM;60671f8c95acf80071bc0943;Hi team,

There are a few of these examples around that are legacy contracts with multiple environments before we had workspaces. We cannot turn these accounts off abruptly or it will cause definite churn.

The intention is to include workspaces in this customer's upcoming December renewal should they continue, so I would just ask we don't change things until beyond December. These separate environment entities are noted within the contract that they have permission to use our services.




Thanks
