column24:
02/Dec/25 4:45 PM;557058:88d83e2d-43e4-43a5-b31a-33176fc7a7c5;Hi [~accountid:5ebc0eae767b660b7762f598] ,

Please review below implementation in sandbox/staging environment and provide your UAT Approval/Feedback for the production deployment.

Thanks

----

A new API endpoint have been developed in the CRM Services. This endpoint accepts an opportunity identifier and a list of product names, and returns:

* Opportunity‑level data for the specified opportunity,
* Account details for the account associated with that opportunity, and
* Order‑level data, but only for those orders that include at least one of the product names supplied in the request.”

The details of the API endpoint are as follows

* Endpoint : 
{noformat}https://crmservices-staging.meltwater.com/opportunity/<OpportunityId>/product_search{noformat}
* HTTP Method: 
{noformat}POST{noformat}
* Payload: 
{noformat}{"product_names": ["Brand Harm Reports", "Brand Performance Reports", "Campaign/Event Reports", "CI - Custom Report (Ad-Hoc)", "CI - Custom Report (Recurring)", "CI - Insight Services (Ad-Hoc)", "CI - Insight Services (Recurring)", "Crisis Monitoring Reports", "Daily Manual Report - Greater China", "Delivery Services - Custom", "Insight Services Support", "Delivery Services - Manual Newsletter Curation - Custom", "Delivery Services - Manually Curated Newsletter - Feedback Loop", "Delivery Services - Manual Newsletter Curation Tier One", "Delivery Services - Manual Newsletter Curation Tier Three", "Delivery Services - Manual Newsletter Curation Tier Two", "Delivery Services - Manual Reporting - Custom", "Delivery Services - Manual Reporting - Tier One", "Delivery Services - Manual Reporting - Tier Three", "Delivery Services - Manual Reporting - Tier Two", "Manually Curated News Briefing", "MDEF", "Meltwater Social Custom Recurring Social Insight Report", "Meltwater Social Monthly Custom Social Insight Report", "Meltwater Social One-Time Custom Social Insight Report", "Meltwater Social Quarterly Custom Social Insight Report", "Monthly Social Insight Reports - 1 Topic", "Monthly Social Insight Reports - 2 Topics", "Monthly Social Insight Reports - 3 Topics", "Monthly Social Insight Reports - 4 Topics", "Quarterly Social Insight Reports - 1 Topic", "Quarterly Social Insight Reports - 2 Topics", "Quarterly Social Insight Reports - 3 Topics", "Quarterly Social Insight Reports - 4 Topics"]}{noformat}
* Response: 
{noformat}{
    "sf_opportunity_id": "006Rf00000PJ02mIAD",
    "opportunity_name": "NBL | SAIF - UPDATED",
    "contract_start_date": "06-09-2025",
    "contract_end_date": "06-08-2026",
    "sales_stage": "Closed Won",
    "type": "Upsell",
    "Account": {
        "sf_account_id": "001Rf000008f2z3IAA",
        "seller_segment": "Enterprise",
        "industry": "Manufacturing"
    },
    "Order": [
        {
            "order_number": "00390347",
            "OrderItems": [
                {
                    "order_line_id": "802Rf000007O6czIAC",
                    "product_name": "Brand Performance Reports",
                    "total_selling_price": "135000.0000",
                    "cogs": "46759.0000"
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}{noformat}

