{color:#333333}Aviral Paliwal commented:{color}

{color:#333333}Hi Michael,{color}

{color:#333333}We checked this with the team, and only one opportunity with MI Company is under the Closed/Won stage.{color}

{color:#333333}As per implementation, when any CRM to MI integration happens, all entitlements are reset by MI, and only entitlements of active orders are integrated in MI, and manually added entitlements are removed.{color}

{color:#333333}This is working as expected because the Entitlements of the active order are synced.{color}

{color:#333333}Please let us know if you have any questions.{color}

{color:#333333}Regards,
Aviral Paliwal{color}
