column16:
31/Jul/25 10:55 AM;557058:d2f6b80a-00e2-4d78-a014-e0b79fae0975;* “MI Company Lifecycle Status” field on [MI Company|https://meltwater.lightning.force.com/lightning/r/Instance__c/a0H5f000009xvAEEAY/view] is showing the Value from the associated [Opportunity |https://meltwater.lightning.force.com/lightning/r/Opportunity/0065f00000IrqmEAAR/view]field “MI Company Lifecycle Status”.
* “MI Company Lifecycle Status” field on  [Opportunity|https://meltwater.lightning.force.com/lightning/r/Opportunity/0065f00000IrqmEAAR/view] value is calculated from below 2 fields on Opportunity:
1. If the Client Opportunity flag is set/true, then “MI Company Lifecycle Status” will be “Customer”
2. Latest Contract End Date >= Today, then “MI Company Lifecycle Status” will be “Customer”

If we remove the Client Opportunity flag, then it will update the “MI Company Lifecycle Status” field to “Prospect” on  [Opportunity|https://meltwater.lightning.force.com/lightning/r/Opportunity/0065f00000IrqmEAAR/view] and [MI Company|https://meltwater.lightning.force.com/lightning/r/Instance__c/a0H5f000009xvAEEAY/view]. And the Allow Login Flag will remain set on [MI Company|https://meltwater.lightning.force.com/lightning/r/Instance__c/a0H5f000009xvAEEAY/view]



