column17:
31/Jul/25 7:16 PM;624acb8345ece00069cc379e;Hi Navya, 

I have attached the email communication for this situation below. The client goes to save a new search or duplicate a search, and they get an error message that they have reached the maximum number of saved searches. 

It sounds like this has something to do with multiple PLI's in their account, and it keeps reverting their account back to the older PLI with a limited number of saved searches. 

If possible, we need to deactivate the old PLI to ensure the system doesn't automatically activate it and limit their saved searches. 

Best, 



--{color:#222222}{color}


{color:#222222}{color}{color:#28bbbb}Chris Sweeney{color} {color:#222222}
