icy@fourthwall.tv]>, [support@structure.ac|mailto:support@structure.ac] <[support@structure.ac|mailto:support@structure.ac]>, [Privacy@sheerid.com|mailto:Privacy@sheerid.com] <[Privacy@sheerid.com|mailto:Privacy@sheerid.com]>, [Compliance@alliantdata.com|mailto:Compliance@alliantdata.com] <[Compliance@alliantdata.com|mailto:Compliance@alliantdata.com]>




  {color:#172B4D}*To the Attention of the Privacy Department / Data Protection Officer / Legal Department of Company Name in TO line,*{color} 
{color:#172B4D} I am submitting this request under  *Section 1798.105 of the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA)* to request that you delete all personal data associated with me from your records, both electronic and paper-based.{color} 
  {color:#172B4D}*Scope of Request*{color} 
* {color:#172B4D} If your processing of my personal data is based on consent,  *I withdraw that consent*.{color}
* {color:#172B4D} If your processing relies on "legitimate interest,"  *I object to that processing*, as there are no overriding legitimate grounds in my case.{color}
* {color:#172B4D} If you are selling my personal data to third parties,  *consider this a formal directive to cease such sales* and provide me with a list of those third parties so I may request deletion directly.{color}
* {color:#172B4D} If my data is being used for  *machine learning, AI model training, or automated decision-making*, I  *explicitly revoke my consent* for such processing.{color}

  {color:#172B4D}*Acknowledgment of Exemptions*{color} 
{color:#172B4D} I recognize that certain exemptions apply under the CCPA, including:{color} 
*   {color:#172B4D}*Financial transactions* (e.g., loan applications, credit reporting).{color}
*   {color:#172B4D}*Federal background investigations* and other legally mandated verifications.{color}
*   {color:#172B4D}*Data retained for compliance with regulatory or legal obligations* (e.g., fraud prevention, law enforcement requests).{color}

{color:#172B4D} If you cannot delete all my personal data due to legal or regulatory requirements, please:{color} 
#   {color:#172B4D}*Specify the exact exemption(s) you are relying on* and the legal obligation requiring retention.{color}
#   {color:#172B4D}*Delete all non-exempt personal data* not covered by such obligations.{color}

  {color:#172B4D}*Identity & Verification*{color} 
{color:#172B4D} To identify me in your records, please use:{color} 
*   {color:#172B4D}*Email address:*{color} [{color:#172B4D}WilliamReitzelDeletionRequest@outlook.com{color}|mailto:WilliamReitzelDeletionRequest@outlook.com]{color:#172B4D}{color}
* {color:#172B4D} DOB: 11/27/1995{color}
* {color:#172B4D} Full Name: William Richard Reitzel{color}
* {color:#172B4D} Current Address: 3056 Flint Dr. APT A Alameda, CA 94501{color}

{color:#172B4D} This request is sent from my personal email account, as verified by email headers. Please do not require additional verification unless legally necessary. If further verification is required,  *explain the legal basis* for your request.{color} 
  {color:#172B4D}*Request for Confirmation*{color} 
{color:#172B4D} Once my data has been deleted, please confirm:{color} 
* {color:#172B4D} The  *deletion of my personal data* from your systems.{color}
* {color:#172B4D} That you have  *notified any third parties* with whom my data was shared to delete their copies as well.{color}

  {color:#172B4D}*Final Notes*{color} 
* {color:#172B4D} My  *preferred method of contact is email*.{color}
* {color:#172B4D} My personal data in this request may  *only* be used for fulfilling this request or for maintaining a suppression list to prevent future data collection.{color}
* {color:#172B4D} Under the CCPA, you  *have 45 days* to comply with this request.{color}

{color:#172B4D} Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter.{color} 
  {color:#172B4D}*Kind regards,*
  *William R. Reitzel*{color}{color:#172B4D}{color}  


