column21:
24/Jun/25 4:27 PM;5fa0f0769494af006edba7b7;Hi [~accountid:557058:88d83e2d-43e4-43a5-b31a-33176fc7a7c5],

Please find the answers below, 

*Question-1:*

Please confirm “Premium support” will be checked automatically if any of the below PLIs exists in active order.


* {color:#36b37e}Premium Enterprise and Essential only.{color}
* {color:#36b37e}Only premium customers have escalated response times for live chat and help@{color}

{color:#36b37e}And for our ticketing process, we have a Premium CoE Tickbox{color}

* {color:#36b37e}Can we have it so if a customer has Premium Essential or Standard+ this indicates it's Pooled CoE!{color}


*Question-2:*

Currently Premium Support on Opportunity is a formula field and refers to Account's Premium Support field.

Account's Premium Support field is a normal check box field.

Shall we update Account's Premium Support field then all opportunities will have the same value and value will be calculated based on all the orders in that Account?

OR We need a field on Opportunity for which value is picked from the orders within that Opportunity only?


* {color:#36b37e}SO, an account could have multiple opportunities, but not all opportunities could have premium support. And in other scenarios, the account has the master contract with all entitlements including premium support across the account/all opportunities.{color}

{color:#36b37e}Ideally, premium is aligned with how the contract is set up,{color}
* {color:#36b37e}if contract is for the entire account inc all opportunities -> apply premium tick box at account level.{color}
* {color:#36b37e}if contract is for a specific opportunity -> only apply premium tick box at opportunity level.{color}

Let me know if any further information is required.

Thank You,
Pritesh Shetty

