column36:
09/Jun/25 6:38 PM;6287880a04eb160068383c04;Hey Jarek, 

Reposting Louise:

{color:#333333}"Louise Loughlin commented:{color}

{color:#333333}Hi{color} [{color:#333333}Mukesh Palsaniya{color}|https://url.de.m.mimecastprotect.com/s/HhZLCA6RLmuNvWLlJiGf2hGoXp4?domain=meltwater.atlassian.net]{color:#333333} this agency (Ganztags) help us with our paid search advertising strategy. We spend approx $800k+ a quarter on paid search advertising globally, and we use tracking codes and unique IDs to track how ad clicks (e.g. in Google) convert to leads and opportunities in Salesforce. We can then pass anonymous revenue data back from Salesforce to the ad platforms, to help us improve ROI on this advertising spend.{color}

{color:#333333}When anything in this tracking system breaks down (from ad platform to Salesforce or vice versa) our ad agency cannot help troubleshoot or fix any issues as they only have visibility on the ad platform data, not what happens to the tracking IDs etc in Salesforce. Therefore we need to get them access to Salesforce."{color}
We went through Legal first- [here is ticket.|https://url.de.m.mimecastprotect.com/s/iEHxCBrVMnI7g4pRJF6hXh2pf3P?domain=meltwater.atlassian.net]

Thanks!{adf}{"type":"expand","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Melissa Snyder","marks":[{"type":"textColor","attrs":{"color":"#28bbbb"}}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Digital Marketing Manager, AMER","marks":[{"type":"textColor","attrs":{"color":"#4c4d4f"}}]}]},{"type":"mediaSingle","attrs":{"layout":"center"},"content":[{"type":"media","attrs":{"type":"external","url":"https://www.meltwater.com/email-signatures/img/logos/meltwater-email-logo.png","height":183,"width":200}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<","marks":[{"type":"textColor","attrs":{"color":"#1155cc"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"https://url.de.m.mimecastprotect.com/s/_5mtCDqXO0F5RVNJruAikhjeqyq?domain=meltwater.com","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://url.de.m.mimecastprotect.com/s/_5mtCDqXO0F5RVNJruAikhjeqyq?domain=meltwater.com"}},{"type":"textColor","attrs":{"color":"#1155cc"}}]},{"type":"text","text":">","marks":[{"type":"textColor","attrs":{"color":"#1155cc"}}]}]}],"attrs":{"title":"Signature"}}{adf}

