---------- Forwarded message ---------
From:  *Bezdenezhnykh, Maria* <[Maria.Bezdenezhnykh@ihg.com|mailto:Maria.Bezdenezhnykh@ihg.com]>
Date: Thu, May 15, 2025 at 5:26 PM
Subject: RE: I keep receiving unsolicited emails and now calls on my personal mobile number - delete my information
To: [privacy@meltwater.com|mailto:privacy@meltwater.com] <[privacy@meltwater.com|mailto:privacy@meltwater.com]>






Hello. Please disclose the information about your collection and use of my personal information, and erase and remove ALL of my information from your database.  



The “Do Not Sell My Personal Information” link at the bottom of your home page does not work – see below: 



!image003.png|thumbnail! 



Thank you!{color:#3d3935}{color} 




 *From:* Jeremy McMahon <[jeremy.mcmahon@meltwater.com|mailto:jeremy.mcmahon@meltwater.com]> 
  *Sent:* Tuesday, May 7, 2024 2:35 PM
  *To:* Bezdenezhnykh, Maria <[maria.bezdenezhnykh@ihg.com|mailto:maria.bezdenezhnykh@ihg.com]>
  *Subject:* Custom List of Tailored Influencers For Your Next Campaign!!!{color:#23272c}{color}{color:#23272c}{color}{color:#23272c}{color}   















{color:#23272c}Hi Maria,{color}{color:#23272c}{color}{color:#23272c}{color}     









{color:#23272c}As part of the Meltwater Enterprise Creator Team, I work hands on with hundreds of brands just like yours, helping them scale their creator programs.{color}{color:#23272c}{color}    





Across all brands, we consistently find that two of the top issues facing our partners are:{color:#23272c}{color}    







{color:#23272c}1.)  *Time wasted finding influencers by endlessly scrolling Instagram and TikTok*{color}{color:#23272c}{color}   





{color:#23272c}2.)  *Vetting these influencers enough to feel confident using them in campaigns that represent your brand*{color}   





 *Would you agree?*{color:#23272c}{color}{color:#23272c}{color}    











For the majority of our Enterprise Partners,  *Meltwater/Klear does both of these manual tasks FOR THEM*, saving our partners on average 20-30 hours per week.{color:#23272c}{color}   







Would love to discuss this further with you, along with  *providing you with 10-20 sample influencers for your next campaign.*    



{color:#23272c}Our Premium Support team and I will gladly put together an incredible list of creators matching your requirements and send them your way in the form of our "Meltwater Creator Cards" (see attached){color}   





 *{color:#23272c} *Just need 15 minutes or so to discover the type of influencer you are currently looking for, and any key audience demographics that you are focusing on.*{color}*   



{color:#23272c}Are you free for a quick call tomorrow?{color}   







{color:#23272c}Thank you and chat soon!{color}    








{color:#28bbbb}Jeremy McMahon |{color}  *{color:#666666} *Enterprise*{color}*  {color:#666666}*Creator Marketing + Strategy*{color} {color:#222222}{color} 

