 * \\Mira - Your Expert Teammate* 🤖  \\ {color}{color:#172B4D} *Mira is an*{color} {color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} {color}{color:#172B4D} *AI teammate that you can use within the Meltwater*{color}{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} {color}{color:#172B4D} *to perform all of your regular tasks in the suite. Simply*{color} {color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} {color}{color:#172B4D} *ask for whatever you need, in plain English,*{color}{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} {color}{color:#172B4D} *whether you want to set up a new search, build a report, or anything else, and Mira will get to work.*{color}{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)}  \\  * \\*{color}{color:#172B4D} *Meltwater for Everyone, with Copilot*{color}{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} {color}{color:#172B4D} {color}{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} {color}{color:#172B4D} *🚀*{color}{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)}  \\ {color}{color:#172B4D} *Meltwater Copilot brings*{color} {color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} {color}{color:#172B4D} *the power of Meltwater to Microsoft Teams*{color}{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} {color}{color:#172B4D} *. What does that mean? Anybody in your organization can simply ask Meltwater for social and news insights, as easily as chatting to a coworker from within the Microsoft apps they’re already using every day.*{color}{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} 
 * \\*{color}{color:#172B4D} *Next Level Social & Media Intelligence with Explore+*{color}{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} {color}{color:#172B4D} {color}{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} 💻  \\ {color}{color:#172B4D} *For large enterprises, we’ve brought together everything that’s great about our social listening, media intelligence, and consumer insights solutions and combined them in a single tool called Explore+. You get the*{color} {color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} {color}{color:#172B4D} *flexibility of unlimited ad-hoc searches*{color}{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} {color}{color:#172B4D} *and the*{color} {color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} {color}{color:#172B4D} *power of deep analytics*{color}{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} {color}{color:#172B4D} *to uncover rich, actionable insights like never before.*{color}{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} 
 * \\Do More with TikTok* {color}{color:#172B4D} *🎶*{color}{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)}  \\ Meltwater can now  *track brand mentions on TikTok* and analyze rising trends, as well as  *planning, publishing, and managing your TikTok content* through our social media management tool, Meltwater Engage. You can even use Spark Ads to boost your top-performing content. 
 *Build Better Relationships* {color}{color:#172B4D} *🤝*{color}{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)}  \\ Whether you’re working with journalists or influencers, the ability to forge strong, fruitful relationships is critical to success. Meltwater now offers  *enhanced media lists and creator profiles with AI-driven audience demographics* to help you pinpoint exactly the right people for your brand, and centralized campaign tracking for more targeted outreach and meaningful engagement. 
 \\  *Want to Know More?*  \\ Meltwater is an industry-leading media and social intelligence suite of solutions, trusted by the world’s most successful brands and agencies. We’d love to show you its full capabilities so you can see exactly how Meltwater can help your organization turn insights into action. {color}{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} {color}|{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)}{color}{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} {color}| 
