{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)}{color}{color:#565656}AI is transforming PR, reshaping how stories are told, trends are predicted, and media relationships are built. But how can PR professionals embrace AI while maintaining credibility and trust? {color}[{color:#565656} Join Meltwater and industry leaders{color}|https://url.de.m.mimecastprotect.com/s/4MSfC83Gy9I6vvmLpuMsxcy3Mze?domain=go.meltwater.com]{color:#565656} for an exclusive webinar on the real impact of AI on PR & Communications—and how to make it work for you.{color}{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)}{color} 
{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)}{color}{color:#565656}In this session, you’ll learn:{color}{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)}{color} 
{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)}{color}* {color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} {color}{color:#565656} *AI & Ethics in PR* – Striking the right balance between automation and authenticity.{color}
{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)}{color}* {color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} {color}{color:#565656} *AI-Driven Storytelling* – Enhancing content creation, press outreach, and journalist engagement.{color}
{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)}{color}* {color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} {color}{color:#565656} *Smarter Media Intelligence* – Using AI-powered insights for better decision-making.{color}
