 *{color:#28bbbb} *Data Digest #7*{color}* | 
| 
{color:#172B4D}The White Lotus, Lisa, and the TV Tourism Phenomenon \\  \\{color} | 
| 
| {color:white}{color}{color:white}Join Webinar{color}{color:white}{color} | 
| {color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)}{color}{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} 
