Welcome back to the Meltwater Data Digest, your monthly deep-dive into today’s marketing trends. This time, we’re examining how TV tourism is playing out in season 3 of Max’s  _The White Lotus_. {color}{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} {color}|{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)}{color}{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} {color}| 
{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} {color}{color:rgba(32,32,32,0.8)} 
