Hi there! 
As the new year approaches you’re probably busy working on your social media strategy, establishing new KPIs, and mapping out your 2025 goals. With so much to think about, it can be tough to keep up with the day-to-day management of your channels. 
That’s where a [ *Social Holidays Calendar*|https://url.de.m.mimecastprotect.com/s/a7J4Ck2YxoTOX8ggrc9sNIGQ-wr?domain=go.meltwater.com] comes in! 
Schedule content that jumps on fun hashtags or poses a question to your followers, encouraging them to engage in conversation. For example, is there an interesting tidbit about your company, products, or industry that not many people know? See if your community can guess for National Trivia Day (January 4)! 
[ *Browse the calendar*|https://url.de.m.mimecastprotect.com/s/a7J4Ck2YxoTOX8ggrc9sNIGQ-wr?domain=go.meltwater.com] for 500+ national days, weeks, and monthly celebrations to round out your social media content for 2025. | 
