05/Jun/24 5:04 PM;5ebc0ebbacdf9c0b91857333;Hi Mukesh,

Thank you for this. This is what Carmen Chan said:
"Essentially there's 2 issues with this account :
The deal is registered under the Closed/Lost opp. That's a CA error. RevOps will be doing a re-training on closing off the correct account soon
With our current sync design, we should have brought in the Closed/Lost opp in Totango since that's where the renewal opps is tied to. However, this opp is also wrong. It is listed as Cross sale, when SFDC already changed the logic to not allow cross sale opp. This is creating sync issues between SFDC <> Totango. [https://meltwater.slack.com/archives/C04BB2E32M7/p1717552052193279?thread_ts=1709022277.434249&cid=C04BB2E32M7|https://url.de.m.mimecastprotect.com/s/vRVUCjYXwnfE8L9qSWbpwF?domain=meltwater.slack.com]"
