column18:
23/May/24 6:00 PM;5f3a8eca42959b00397651e9;Hi [~accountid:5ebc0eb596bbcb0b85b422a9],

As we discussed on Slack, the opportunities which are missing are all renewal cases. Renewal opportunities would fulfill the following conditions to show in Totango:

{panel:bgColor=#deebff}
{{(account.customer_status__c = 'Customer' AND (Type='Renewal' and Parent_New_Business_Opportunity__r.type='New Business' AND Existing_Contract_End_Date__c>=TODAY and Parent_New_Business_Opportunity__r.UUID__c != NULL)))}}
{panel}

If it fills, the opportunities will be shown. If opportunities are not showing in Totango after fulfilling these conditions, you can reach out to the CX team or Please post your message in the [#totango-go-live|https://meltwater.slack.com/archives/C062ZAX1WDB] channel.

I hope it helps.

Thanks,
Ayush

