---------- Forwarded message ---------
From:  *Dan Renzi* <[danielrenzi@gmail.com|mailto:danielrenzi@gmail.com]>
Date: Mon, Apr 1, 2024 at 11:01 PM
Subject: please remove me from your system
To: <[privacy@meltwater.com|mailto:privacy@meltwater.com]>



Hello,



{color:#333333}

 I am a journalist and I am listed in Meltwater's database, somewhere. I would like to be removed from your system please, so I don't receive any more communications, story pitches, or anything through your company or the people who pay for your services. 

I receive so many story pitches, and none of them are relevant to any of the work that I do. I am just a little freelance journalist, I am never going to write about any of the topics that your customers want me to write about. 

Please, any information that you have about me, delete me, I do not want to be contacted anymore. 

Thank you,
 Daniel Renzi (aka Dan Renzi)  *--------*{color}  



