{color}{color:#000066}Please confirm that you have received this request and notify us when the erasure of the aforementioned data has been completed by emailing us at{color} {color:#172B4D}{color}[{color:#172B4D}{color}{color:#000066}removalrequest@goinvisible.io{color}{color:#172B4D}{color}|mailto:removalrequest@goinvisible.io]{color:#172B4D}{color}{color:#000099}.{color}{color:#172B4D} {color}{color:#000066}If you are unable to comply with this request, please provide a detailed explanation as to why.{color}{color:#172B4D}
