Circling back on my previous note!   



{color:#23272c}Meltwater has been busy over the last 12 months conducting a lot of research & development. In turn loads of product updates from our acquisition spree in 2022-23 which included{color} social intelligence platform{color:#23272c},{color} [{color:#1155cc}Linkfluence{color}|https://protect-de.mimecast.com/s/EpEaCVvwDNcy8gp7IEJLih?domain=meltwater.mxelm.com]{color:#23272c}, social influencers platform{color}[{color:#1155cc}Klear{color}|https://protect-de.mimecast.com/s/OMGACWPxE8cq8Dn2hOpIZ1?domain=meltwater.mxelm.com]{color:#23272c}, and most recently, sales intelligence company,{color} [{color:#1155cc}Owler{color}|https://protect-de.mimecast.com/s/paF6CXQyGMsKZOL1TQsM95?domain=meltwater.mxelm.com].   



Through successfully integrating the above tools, we can now offer holistic news + social datasets for brand, industry, and consumer insights - [here is an example of how we can action this data to build full audience personas to target.|https://protect-de.mimecast.com/s/z4PkCY7zJMhlXAyQsQdXHz?domain=shared.audiense.com]   



 *{color:#23272c} *As mentioned, I’ve put together an full 2023 media analysis for Yamaha Unified Communications and can also incorporate similar audience demographic insights.*{color}*   



Are you free for quick call to discuss further?   



Best,   

Luke   




