column27:
03/Jan/24 11:36 PM;63d7fa6ac2b1cb6b346f5749;Hey Team - Inline feedback below, appreciate the thoughtful questions here all.. 



{color:#500050}1) Should this automation logic be applied while creating the renewal opportunity or should this be applied for the update scenario as well?{color}
{color:#500050}For example if someone updates the renewal opp owner manually (sets Opportunity owner to someone who is not the renewal manager on account), should the automation be triggered to set the renewal opp owner to Renewal manager, if the account has a renewal manager on account team?{color} {color:#ff0000}The automation should be applied when creating the renewal opportunities, if there's a manual adjustment on the opportunity owner, that can take priority as there could be cases an opportunity owner is adjusted due to $$$ size or OOO schedules.{color} 

{color:#500050}2) If the renewal manager on account gets added at a later point after the renewal opportunity creation, how should the ownership logic be handled?{color} {color:#ff0000}If a renewal manager is added to the 'account team' table later, we'd want the system to pick this up and automatically flip the renewal opportunity owners to the RM.{color} 

{color:#333333}For{color} {color:#333333}{color}!https://meltwater.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10517?size=medium!{color:#333333} BASD-21325  <[https://protect-de.mimecast.com/s/KXiuCVvwDNco3EpAHGBMLx?domain=meltwater.atlassian.net]>Waiting for support , we will fix the data first as that will be a quick solution and will work on the automation logic in parallel to handle future scenarios. Please provide your approval for the data fix.{color}

{color:#333333}Thanks,{color}

