|415.361.0001 \\[elena@crosschq.com|mailto:elena@crosschq.com]| 
{quote}{color:#172B4D}{color}






can be found in your databases and remove them if found? Please confirm to me, don’t communicate directly to them.


@Help: just to specify the request, this is an Option 1 request as detailed in the Wiki Article: [https://meltwater.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/T3/pages/12591202305/Personal+Data+Removal+Request+Support+Workflow|https://protect-de.mimecast.com/s/_1UQCVvwDNcQ26rRsGzWoI?domain=meltwater.atlassian.net]
{quote}
{quote}
