Anna
{quote}
|
|
|
|
|Hi Lena! \\  \\I go by the same name as you (: \\  \\I have a favor to ask. In early 2021, I signed a contract with Meltwater for $7,500 as a brand-new employee, only to find out that I did not have signing authority. The very next day, I contacted my sales rep at Meltwater to see if they could please reverse it as I was afraid I would get fired. \\  \\They wouldn't. \\  \\So instead, I quietly paid for it out of my own pocket, on a monthly basis, while my husband was out of work with three kids at home. It was a huge financial strain. And I also didn't use the product during this time because it made me physically ill that I was having to pay this while my own family was under such hardship.  \\  \\Since then, I have continued to get sales calls to re-engage with Meltwater. Each time, I tell them to please remove me from their list. Every few months, I get another call.  \\  \\I was a HUGE Meltwater fan - I had been a prior customer which is why I wanted to go with Meltwater at my new company. But after all that has happened, I don't think I ever could be again which makes me sad because I really love your product. \\  \\So, my favor I'm asking you - is to please have me permanently removed from all lists. I think you can understand. I've never spoken negatively about Meltwater as I think that's horrible when people put individuals and companies on blast.  \\  \\But if you could do this one thing, I'd be grateful. Thank you in advance for your help Lena! \\  \\Best, \\  \\Lena \\415.361.0001 \\[elena@crosschq.com|mailto:elena@crosschq.com]| 
{quote}

