column11:
Please investigate removing any information for the linked user. 
Description from DATACOMP Ticket
----------- Forwarded message ---------
From:  *Jim Kerwood* <[jim.kerwood@bromford.co.uk|mailto:jim.kerwood@bromford.co.uk]>
Date: Thu, May 4, 2023 at 11:32 AM
Subject: Personal details
To: [privacy@meltwater.com|mailto:privacy@meltwater.com] <[privacy@meltwater.com|mailto:privacy@meltwater.com]>





{color:#172B4D} Hi team,{color}  {color:#172B4D}{color} 

{color:#172B4D} I've been contacted by colleagues from your sales team. I work at a company called Bromford in the UK and am very concerned that I'm being contacted on a personal number rather than my business number. I've asked for my personal mobile number be removed from your records in the past, yet I'm still receiving sales calls.{color}  {color:#172B4D}{color} 

{color:#172B4D} I'm happy to be contacted through the correct business email and business number but unsure how my personal number was obtained and ask again, for it to be removed please.{color} {color:#172B4D}{color} 

{color:#172B4D}{color} [{color:#172B4D}jim.kerwood@bromford.co.uk{color}|mailto:jim.kerwood@bromford.co.uk]{color:#172B4D} is the email address you have for me and I've been contacted by amongst others{color} [{color:#172B4D}cassandra.mayer@meltwater.com{color}|mailto:cassandra.mayer@meltwater.com]{color:#172B4D}{color} {color:#172B4D}{color} 

