06/Mar/23 5:21 PM;5dea7c2f8389de0cd335ac29;Hi Mukesh

There are 900 accounts in the Self Serve organisation in Australia.

I don't want to go into each account and review every search, it would take too long. 

I was hoping I could create a target list of accounts that had exceptionally high search result volume and focus on tidying up these accounts first.

We used to get notifications when clients searches had too many wildcards for example and was pulling too many results. It's a version of this I guess so we can determine which accounts have high search results volume and therefore, need cleaning up to make the searches valuable.

I initially logged an MI ticket and they directed me to this ticket type. This is the original ticket for review if you like. {color:#1f1f1f}MWTR-367548{color}










































